title: "frechet-edit: strong Frechet edit distance, discrete and continuous, with verifiable witnesses"
message: >-
  This software is an INDEPENDENT implementation of algorithms published by
  Fox, Nayyeri, Perry and Raichel. If you use it, please cite BOTH this
  software and the original paper below. Citing this software is not a citation
  of the underlying result.
